  << /ActualText (Starting from the Hi\055Fi wireframes\054 I worked a prototype\054 so validating the solution could be possible avoiding any development\056 We tested all the analysed journeys and the result has been interesting\056 The task completion rate\054 the metric we fixed as main\054 increased drastically from 43\045 to 91\045\056 The lower limit to approve the idea has been fixed to 90\045 of completion rate\056 The tested solution got the approval from the owners and the product has been developed as per new requirements\056)
